lines += ['', '## Reproduction and verification', 'Run HONE_GROUND_MODE=0/1/2 python code/run.py <fresh-output>. Score candidate-manifest.json with scoring/score_candidate.py --output <fresh-score>. Run compare_controls.py, summarize.py and the independent tests. All source, compiler flags, binaries and input hashes are recorded in each run. No model, geometry, source images or raw output buffers are placed in the private code/report bundle.', 'Independent final review passed: 60 O2 ASan/UBSan actual renders, 120 RGB/depth buffers, 4,620 non-timing metadata fields and 4,050 metric values all agree. Core O0/O2 sanitizer fixtures, loader/ownership/generation/budget/alias checks and 34 additional scorer metadata mutations passed. The source/side-emission evidence is artifact/source audited, not an independent Blender rerender. Controlled CPU statistics are separately reviewed. No default adoption, public redistribution, PR, flash or actual-device test.']
